Question 5 — Mixed Concepts

Using the employees and departments tables:

Find all departments whose average salary is greater than the overall average salary of all employees.

SELECT d.DepartmentName, ROUND(AVG(e.Salary),2) AS AverageSalary FROM employees e
JOIN departments d ON e.DepartmentID = d.DepartmentID
GROUP BY d.DepartmentID
HAVING AVG(e.Salary) > (SELECT AVG(Salary) FROM employees);
